Patch targets
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

kernels/patches/ contains scripts that edit a local vLLM checkout in place. They
quote short anchor strings from vLLM sources (Apache 2.0,
https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm) in order to locate the text they replace.
No vLLM source file is redistributed here.
